.el .ds Aq '
.TH create 1  "create " 
.SH NAME
create \- Create a new knowledge element
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBcreate\fR <\fB\-\-title\fR> [\fB\-\-description\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIELEMENT_TYPE\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Create a new knowledge element
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-title\fR \fI<TITLE>\fR
Title of the knowledge element
.TP
\fB\-\-description\fR \fI<DESCRIPTION>\fR
Optional detailed description
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIELEMENT_TYPE\fR>
Type of element to create (e.g. requirement, constraint, design\-decision, implementation, artifact)
